            "title": "全日成交｜港股升467點曾升555點  國常會出招撐市科技股狂飆  11月三大指數俱跌",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股指結算日適逢內地出招撐市，午後港股跳升，AI及晶片股領漲，多家股份錄雙位數升幅，恒指升逾2%，科指升近6.5%，一周計三大指數升逾1%至逾3%，惟11月全月仍報跌。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"港股 AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股3.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"港股 AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股3.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">港股 AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生指數全日升467點或2.11%，報22,694，今早開升36點或0.17%，報22,263 ; 早段見22,263，升37點或0.16%，為全日低位，中午內地公布國務院常務委員會宣布多項撐市措施，升幅迅速擴大，最高見22,781，升555點或2.49%，為全日高位。</p>\n<!-- slider begin -->\n<div class=\"fancy-slider\">\n<p class=\"fancy-gallery-tips\" style=\"font-weight: bold;font-size: 18px; margin: 0\">點擊看圖輯</p>\n<div class=\"fancy-main\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"港股 AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股3.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"港股 AP圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">港股 AP圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：中芯國際官網\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/01/20250108_FI_source-web_00981.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：中芯國際官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/01/20250108_FI_source-web_00981.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：中芯國際官網</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：智譜官網\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/12/20251211_FI_source-web_Zhipu-1.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：智譜官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/12/20251211_FI_source-web_Zhipu-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：智譜官網</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"內地銀行。AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250424_FI_source-ap_China_Banks.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"內地銀行。AP圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250424_FI_source-ap_China_Banks.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">內地銀行。AP圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__controls\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__controls-text bpcategory-special-color\">更多相片</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__buttons\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __prev fancy-main-prev\" style=\"border-right: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n<div class=\"rule\"></div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __next fancy-main-next\" style=\"border-left: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"港股 AP圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">港股 AP圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：中芯國際官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/01/20250108_FI_source-web_00981.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：中芯國際官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：智譜官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/12/20251211_FI_source-web_Zhipu-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：智譜官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"內地銀行。AP圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250424_FI_source-ap_China_Banks.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">內地銀行。AP圖片</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- slider end -->\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數全日升6.45%或220點，報3,637，今早開升16點或0.47%，報3,433 ; 科指一周升126點或3.58%，11月累升</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生國企指數全日升150點或2.01%，報7,644，今早開升7點或0.11%，報7,501點</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">大市成交2,571.4億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">一周累計，恒指升284點或1.26%，11月累跌600點或2.57% ; 科指一周升126點或3.58%，11月累跌117點或3.11% ;國指一周升90點或1.19%，11月累跌218點或2.77%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">即月期指升327點或1.47%，報22,528，低水167點 ; 科指期貨升152點或4.45%，低水71點 ; 國指期貨升111點或1.48%，報7,596，低水48點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">國務院常務委員會中午公布撐市措施，包括提出「國家隊」要穩定市場，平準基金要發揮作用 ; 上市公司要分紅等，為一個月內第二次，規模也遠較上次大。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">晶片股升幅領先，華虹宏力(01347)大升20.7%，報78.15元 ; 中芯國際(00981)升16.39%，報53.4元，成交129.1億元排第二位，超越騰訊(00700)及阿里巴巴(09988)，一家美資量化交易公司SIG為主力買入機構，成恒指第二大推手，貢獻恒指50點。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：中芯國際官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/01/20250108_FI_source-web_00981.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：中芯國際官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/01/20250108_FI_source-web_00981.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：中芯國際官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">阿里巴巴(09988)升7.03%，報88.3元，貢獻恒指106點，為恒指最大貢獻者 ; 騰訊(00700)升3.23%，報352元 ; 美團(03690)績前造好，收升8.21%，報67.85元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AI相關股飆升，智譜(02513)升16.39%，報347.4元 ; MINIMAX(00100)17.19%，報110.1元; 建滔積層板(01888)升10.93%，報23.96元 ; 中際旭創(03308)升16.02%，報597.5元 ; 長飛光纖(06869)升12.64%，報78元。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：智譜官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/12/20251211_FI_source-web_Zhipu-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：智譜官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/12/20251211_FI_source-web_Zhipu-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：智譜官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">中國神華(01088)全日跌5.28%，報39.1元，為表現最差藍籌股。集團折讓7.7%配股集資逾67億元償還境內內債務，為2005年香港上市以首次配售新H股。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">內銀沽壓大，建設銀行(00939)跌2.88%，報10.13元，入20大成交額 ; 工商銀行((01398)跌2.74%，報7.625元 ; 招商銀行(03968)跌2.44%，報52.05元。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"內地銀行。AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250424_FI_source-ap_China_Banks.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"內地銀行。AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250424_FI_source-ap_China_Banks.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">內地銀行。AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17275527-%e5%85%a8%e6%97%a5%e6%88%90%e4%ba%a4%ef%bd%9c%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1%e5%8d%87467%e9%bb%9e%e6%9b%be%e5%8d%87555%e9%bb%9e-%e5%9c%8b%e5%b8%b8%e6%9c%83%e5%87%ba%e6%8b%9b%e6%92%90%e5%b8%82%e7%a7%91%e6%8a%80",
