            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "A股午後飆  兩市成交近2萬億  創板升逾11%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A股午後飛升，深股升逾7%以全日高位收市，創業板升逾11%。兩市成交合計19997.94億元(人民幣‧下同)一周計滬股升逾2%，深股升半成，全月計深股仍跌。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20240307_FI_source-ap_AShare-14.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20240307_FI_source-ap_AShare-14.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬綜指升129點或3.73%，報3606點，午後撐市措施公布後飆升，最高曾見3,610，升134點或3.85%，全日成交9,297.77億元。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深成指收升729點或7.24%，報10,814，以全日高位收市，成交10,700.17億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬綜指一周升73點或2.06%，11月全月升7點或0.19%。深成指全周升558點或5.44%，11月跌19點或0.17%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬深300升162點或4.17%，報4,063 ; 創業板指數升254點或11.61%，報2,443點</p>\n</div>",
